Subject: [PATCH 1/2] qwen-metal P0A-1: parity pins + sustained loop for
 LLMEval

Revision-pinned mlx-community/Qwen3-1.7B-4bit@3b1b1768; greedy (temp 0);
sustained regenerate-loop toggle with cumulative token counters (energy
protocol). Base: 378f2449. See qwen-metal DECISIONS.md 2026-08-22.
---
